# The boot safety net (CLAUDE.md "Startup graphics chooser"), forced to fire: pick Full graphics on the
# chooser and arm the net at 1 ms, so the first frames after loading "fail" and it steps down to Planetarium.
#   python tools/harness/run.py tools/harness/scripts/boot_safety.satcmd --boot-chooser 0 --boot-safety-ms 1
expect state.render.boot_choice 0
expect state.render.full_sky_deferred false
wait 400   # frames: `wait seconds` holds one frame, and the net needs frames
state stepped
expect state.render.preset Planetarium
capture banner ui=on scale=0.5
